<catalogue name="Codex - Space Wolves" id="8d0e-9c4e-17af-ed93" authorName="Boff" battleScribeVersion="2.03" gameSystemId="9ea8-c89d-9104-ed03" gameSystemRevision="23" library="false" revision="13" type="catalogue" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema">
  <readme>Terminators cannot add the teleport ability (which you need to increase their points by 50%) due to a limitation in Battlescribe. No way to modify the points in that way. 

If they ever change that I will update. Until then, ye olde calcuator will do!</readme>
