    <profile name="The Animus Malorum" id="cd72-030f-1907-2d9e" hidden="false" publicationId="8eed-45fd-d4be-9a1b" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">During Psychic phase may target a single living enemy model within 12&quot;. You may use between 1 and 3 Force cards to power the skull. Roll a D6 for every Force card used. If the result is more than the target&apos;s Ld value then the model is killed regardless of Wounds or armour. If killed in this way then you may resurrect a dead Legion of the Damned model, placed within normal unit coherency. Cannot increase unit beyond original size. Can be nullified like a psychic power on a 4+</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
